hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"85","[AI-translation] Hamein bataya Muhammad bin Marzuq Abu Abdullah ne, unhon ne kaha: hamein bataya Abdur Rahman bin Qais Abu Muawiyah ne, unhon ne kaha: hamein bataya Hisham ne, Muhammad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke jootay ki do doriyan thi, aur Abu Bakr aur Umar ki bhi, aur sab se pehle jis ne ek dori bandhi wo Uthman (radiyallahu anhu) the."
"86","[AI-translation] Hamein bataya Qutaibah bin Said ne, aur ek se zyada logon ne, Abdullah bin Wahb se, Yunus se, Ibn Shihab se, Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka angoothi chandi ki thi aur uska pathar Habashi tha."
"87","[AI-translation] Hamein bataya Qutaibah ne, unhon ne bataya Abu Awanah se, Abu Bishr se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chandi ki ek angoothi banwayi, pas wo usse muhr lagate aur nahi pehante the."
"88","[AI-translation] Hamein bataya Mahmud bin Ghailan ne, unhon ne kaha: hamein bataya Hafs bin Umar bin Ubaid (yani Tanafisi) ne, unhon ne kaha: hamein bataya Zuhair Abu Khaithamah ne, Humaid se, Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka angoothi chandi ka tha, uska pathar bhi usi ka tha."
"89","[AI-translation] Hamein bataya Ishaq bin Mansoor ne, unhon ne kaha: hamein bataya Muaz bin Hisham ne, unhon ne kaha: mujhe meray waalid ne bataya, Qatadah se, Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: jab Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ajam ko khat likhna chaaha to unse kaha gaya: ajam aisa khat nahi qubool karte jis par muhr (angoothi) na ho, pas unhon ne ek angoothi banwayi, goya main uski safedi unke hath mein dekh raha hoon."
"90","[AI-translation] Hamein bataya Muhammad bin Yahya ne, unhon ne kaha: hamein bataya Muhammad bin Abdullah Ansari ne, unhon ne kaha: mujhe meray waalid ne bataya, Thumamah se, Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki angoothi ka naqsha yeh tha: Muhammad ek saf, Rasool ek saf, aur Allah ek saf."
"91","[AI-translation] Hamein bataya Nasr bin Ali Jahdami Abu Amr ne, unhon ne kaha: hamein bataya Nuh bin Qais ne, Khalid bin Qais se, Qatadah se, Anas bin Malik se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Kisra, Qaisar aur Najashi ko khat likha, pas unhe kaha gaya: wo khat nahi qubool karte magar jis par muhr ho, pas Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek angoothi banwayi jiski halqa chandi ki thi, aur usmein naqsha hua: Muhammad Rasool Allah."
"92","[AI-translation] Hamein bataya Ishaq bin Mansoor ne, unhon ne kaha: hamein bataya Said bin Aamir aur Hajjaj bin Minhal ne, Hammam se, Ibn Juraij se, Zuhri se, Anas bin Malik se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab khalaa (baitul khala) mein dakhil hote to apni angoothi utaar dete."
